  "faqs": [
    {
      "question": "Can I change plans later?",
      "answer": "Yes! You can upgrade or downgrade your plan at any time. Upgrades take effect immediately, while downgrades take effect at the end of your current billing cycle to ensure you get the full value of your current plan."
    },
    {
      "question": "What payment methods do you accept?",
      "answer": "We accept all major credit cards (Visa, Mastercard, American Express) and bank transfers for annual plans. Enterprise customers can arrange custom payment terms including invoicing."
    },
    {
      "question": "Is there a free trial?",
      "answer": "Yes! All paid plans come with a 14-day free trial. No credit card required to start. You'll have full access to all features during the trial period."
    },
    {
      "question": "What's included in support?",
      "answer": "Every plan includes support by email. Phone support, set response times and a named account contact are not offered yet."
    },
    {
      "question": "Can I get a refund if I'm not satisfied?",
      "answer": "Refunds are not automatic. Plans renew until you cancel, and cancelling stops future renewals, as our Terms of Service set out. If you think you have been charged in error, email hello@leangency.com and we will look into it."
    },
    {
      "question": "What happens to my data if I cancel?",
      "answer": "You can export all your data at any time. After cancellation, your data is retained for 30 days, giving you time to export it. After 30 days, all data is permanently deleted according to our data retention policy."
    },
    {
      "question": "Do prices include VAT?",
      "answer": "Prices shown are exclusive of VAT. VAT will be added at checkout based on your location and business status. EU businesses can provide a valid VAT number for B2B reverse charge."
    }
  ],
